// Pest Control — Cross the gangplank onto the waiting lander craft.
// Loc 14315 is jm2 L1 but LINK_BELOW stores it at L0. Player dest is the
// craft floor (occupancy + walkable), not the L1 plank tile (midair).
// Stand 2657,2639 L0. Dest 2660,2640 L0. Boarding mes CANDIDATE from the
// 18 Apr 2006 launch news ("boats leave when enough have boarded").
// No queue / min-players (min=1 is a smoke toy). Not m41_40. No %pest_instance.
// Cite xl-minigames-remaining-impl-377.md B.1 + B.2 unit 11.

[oploc1,pest_lander_gangplank]
p_telejump(0_41_41_36_16); // 2660,2640 L0 — waiting-craft deck
mes("You board the waiting lander. The boat will leave when enough volunteers have boarded.");
